{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#card-zh","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话管理插件，在侧栏会话行的菜单中加入单条删除和批量删除入口。用户确认后，插件会停止并落盘正在运行的会话，将会话及其子代理会话移入 Windows 回收站，并清理投影缓存、工作区和归档记录；批量模式支持勾选、全选、逐项处理和失败后继续。它适合需要整理会话列表、同时清除子代理记录的 DSH 用户。使用需 Windows 系统及可用回收站，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:880-925","lib/index.js:571-615"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#card-en","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-remover adds single and batch deletion to DSH sidebar menus. It stops active sessions, moves them and their subagent sessions to the Windows Recycle Bin, and clears related records. Batch mode supports selection and retrying remaining items. Windows and a usable Recycle Bin are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:880-925","lib/index.js:571-615"]}
