{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#feature-1","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 的功能「单条删除」：从侧栏某个会话行的菜单选择删除并确认，即可提交该会话编号。插件会停止并落盘活动会话，再将会话目录移入回收站。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:880-909","lib/index.js:571-587"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#feature-2","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 的功能「批量删除」：从侧栏菜单打开批量浮层，勾选会话并确认后，插件逐个发送删除请求，显示进度；失败时保留未处理项，可继续操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:610-624","lib/client.js:650-696"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#feature-3","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 的功能「连带清理子代理会话」：删除目标对话时，按会话日志中的父子关系收集子代理后代，并先处理后代目录；由 fork 产生的独立会话不跟随删除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:184-234"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#feature-4","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 的功能「移入回收站」：后端为删除目标创建系统脚本并调用 Windows 回收站接口，检查目标路径和移动结果；没有可用回收站时会中止操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-249","lib/index.js:337-380"]}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__dsh-session-remover#caveat-1","repo":"sailoumili/dsh-session-remover","commit":"736219237dd3cfd3f7cc8484d1342d0eeae4a783","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-remover 使用 Windows 的 cscript.exe 将会话移入系统回收站；非 Windows 环境或没有可用回收站的磁盘上，删除操作会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-245","lib/index.js:337-349"]}
